      "created_at": "2024-03-08T12:47:09.525Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello, is there any way for me to duplicate (like a new entry) the current sales invoice document using python server side scripting with all of its data and be able to modify some of it on_submit? For context it’s like a sales invoice document but with only the taxes so I can print it seperately.</p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>",
