      "username": "Praveenkumar",
      "name": "Praveenkumar",
      "created_at": "2024-03-11T01:14:14.649Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can achieve it using copy_doc(). To refer more <a href=\"https://frappeframework.com/docs/user/en/api/document\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Document API</a></p>\n<p>E.g:<br>\nsales_invoice = frappe.get_doc(“Sales Invoice”, invoice_name)<br>\nnew_sales_invoice = frappe.copy_doc(sales_invoice)<br>\nChange needed details using new_sales_invoice<br>\nnew_sales_invoice.save()</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>",
